      "summaries": {
        "en": "Karakeep is a self-hostable bookmark manager that saves links, notes, and images. It solves the problem of organizing digital clutter by using AI for automatic tagging and full-text search. Technically, it leverages local AI models to classify content and make retrieval intuitive. You can self-host via Docker, integrate browser extensions for quick saving, and extend functionality through its API for custom workflows or personal knowledge management.",
        "zh": "Karakeep 是一款可自托管的书签管理应用，支持保存链接、笔记和图片，旨在解决数字信息杂乱问题。核心能力在于利用本地AI模型自动为内容打标签，并提供全文搜索，让检索变得直观。其技术亮点是AI分类与搜索的结合，无需依赖外部服务。使用方法简单：通过Docker一键部署，配合浏览器扩展快速收藏，还可利用API自定义工作流。适合个人知识管理、研究资料整理，打造属于自己的书签库。",
        "es": "Karakeep is a self-hostable bookmark manager that saves links, notes, and images. It solves the problem of organizing digital clutter by using AI for automatic tagging and full-text search. Technically, it leverages local AI models to classify content and make retrieval intuitive. You can self-host via Docker, integrate browser extensions for quick saving, and extend functionality through its API for custom workflows or personal knowledge management.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "karakeep stands out for bookmark-manager, bookmarks, and bookmarks-manager in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Karakeep is a self-hostable bookmark manager that saves links, notes, and images. It solves the problem of organizing digital clutter by using AI for automatic tagging and full-text search. Technically, it leverages local AI models to classify content and make retrieval intuitive. You can self-host via Docker, integrate browser extensions for quick saving, and extend functionality through its API for custom workflows or personal knowledge management.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/karakeep-app/karakeep for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
