      "summaries": {
        "en": "Gas Town is an open-source multi-agent workspace manager that orchestrates teams of AI agents to collaborate on complex tasks. It uses a shared workspace to manage state and context across agents, enabling coherent multi-step workflows through task delegation and communication. Developers define agent roles and workflows in Go, then deploy Gas Town to automate research, content generation, or software development pipelines where multiple specialized agents need to cooperate efficiently.",
        "zh": "Gas Town 是一个开源的多智能体工作空间管理器，专为需要多个AI代理协作完成复杂任务的场景设计。其核心通过共享工作空间来管理代理间的状态与上下文，实现高效的沟通与任务委派，保证多步骤工作流的一致性与可追踪性。开发者可利用Go语言定义不同代理角色并编排工作流程，快速搭建自动化研究、内容生成或软件开发等领域的多代理协作系统，从而提升任务执行效率与灵活性。",
        "es": "Gas Town is an open-source multi-agent workspace manager that orchestrates teams of AI agents to collaborate on complex tasks. It uses a shared workspace to manage state and context across agents, enabling coherent multi-step workflows through task delegation and communication. Developers define agent roles and workflows in Go, then deploy Gas Town to automate research, content generation, or software development pipelines where multiple specialized agents need to cooperate efficiently.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "gastown gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "Gas Town is an open-source multi-agent workspace manager that orchestrates teams of AI agents to collaborate on complex tasks. It uses a shared workspace to manage state and context across agents, enabling coherent multi-step workflows through task delegation and communication. Developers define agent roles and workflows in Go, then deploy Gas Town to automate research, content generation, or software development pipelines where multiple specialized agents need to cooperate efficiently.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/gastownhall/gastown for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
