      "summaries": {
        "en": "Claude-video enables Anthropic’s Claude model to “watch” videos by bridging dynamic visual content and static text understanding. It downloads a video, extracts representative frames, transcribes speech via Whisper, and sends both visual and audio context to Claude for reasoning. Technically, it converts temporal video data into a multimodal prompt within Claude’s context window using frame sampling and transcription rather than real-time processing. Users can analyze lecture recordings, summarize meeting videos, or moderate content by running `/watch [URL or file]` to receive insights. This tool suits teams needing AI video understanding without custom pipelines.",
        "zh": "claude-video 使 Claude 模型能够“观看”视频，弥补动态视觉内容与静态文本理解的鸿沟。它下载视频后提取代表性帧，通过 Whisper 转录语音，再将视觉与音频上下文一并交给 Claude 推理。技术上将时域视频转化为适合 Claude 上下文窗口的多模态提示，采用帧采样与转写而非实时处理。输入 `/watch [链接]` 即可分析课程录像、总结会议或审查内容。适合需要 AI 视频理解而无须定制管线的团队。",
        "es": "Claude-video enables Anthropic’s Claude model to “watch” videos by bridging dynamic visual content and static text understanding. It downloads a video, extracts representative frames, transcribes speech via Whisper, and sends both visual and audio context to Claude for reasoning. Technically, it converts temporal video data into a multimodal prompt within Claude’s context window using frame sampling and transcription rather than real-time processing. Users can analyze lecture recordings, summarize meeting videos, or moderate content by running `/watch [URL or file]` to receive insights. This tool suits teams needing AI video understanding without custom pipelines.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "claude-video gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "Claude-video enables Anthropic’s Claude model to “watch” videos by bridging dynamic visual content and static text understanding. It downloads a video, extracts representative frames, transcribes speech via Whisper, and sends both visual and audio context to Claude for reasoning. Technically, it converts temporal video data into a multimodal prompt within Claude’s context window using frame sampling and transcription rather than real-time processing. Users can analyze lecture recordings, summarize meeting videos, or moderate content by running `/watch [URL or file]` to receive insights. This tool suits teams needing AI video understanding without custom pipelines.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/bradautomates/claude-video for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
