      "summaries": {
        "en": "EmbeddingGemma-300M-GGUF is a quantized version of Google's lightweight embedding model, optimized for efficient text representation in retrieval and semantic search tasks. Its GGUF format enables fast CPU inference with reduced memory footprint, making it ideal for local deployment. Use it directly with llama.cpp or compatible frameworks for tasks like RAG, clustering, or similarity search without needing a GPU.",
        "zh": "EmbeddingGemma-300M-GGUF是Google轻量级嵌入模型EmbeddingGemma的量化版本，专为高效文本嵌入设计。通过GGUF格式的量化压缩，模型在保持精度的同时大幅降低内存占用并加速推理，甚至可在CPU上流畅运行。核心技术在于利用llama.cpp等工具实现高效部署，特别适合语义搜索、RAG（检索增强生成）、文档聚类等场景。无需GPU即可在本地快速处理大规模文本，是构建轻量级检索系统的实用选择。",
        "es": "EmbeddingGemma-300M-GGUF is a quantized version of Google's lightweight embedding model, optimized for efficient text representation in retrieval and semantic search tasks. Its GGUF format enables fast CPU inference with reduced memory footprint, making it ideal for local deployment. Use it directly with llama.cpp or compatible frameworks for tasks like RAG, clustering, or similarity search without needing a GPU.",
